sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Dashboard)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant B as Agent Brain
    participant TR as Task Router
    participant WP as Workflow Planner
    participant DE as Decision Engine
    participant WE as Wave Executor
    participant AG as Agent Pool
    participant RAG as Dual RAG
    participant EXT as External Providers
    participant MEM as Memory + Learning
    participant DB as Supabase / Redis

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/campaign/create
    API->>B: Parse intent + validate

    rect rgb(108, 99, 255, 0.1)
        Note over B,WE: BRAIN ORCHESTRATION
        B->>TR: Route task (priority, type, agent affinity)
        TR->>WP: Build execution DAG
        WP->>WP: Resolve dependencies
        WP->>DE: Score candidate strategies
        DE->>DE: Evaluate paths (cost, latency, quality)
        DE->>WE: Dispatch execution waves
    end

    rect rgb(0, 184, 148, 0.1)
        Note over WE,AG: PARALLEL AGENT EXECUTION
        WE->>AG: Wave 1: Strategist + Analytics (parallel)
        AG->>RAG: Retrieve brand context
        RAG-->>AG: Injected context
        AG->>EXT: Strategist → OpenAI (GPT-4)
        AG->>EXT: Analytics → GA4 + GSC
        EXT-->>AG: Strategy plan + performance data
        AG-->>WE: Wave 1 complete

        WE->>AG: Wave 2: SEO + Content (parallel, depends on Wave 1)
        AG->>RAG: Retrieve internal playbooks
        RAG-->>AG: Injected knowledge
        AG->>EXT: SEO → DataForSEO + SerpAPI
        AG->>EXT: Content → OpenAI (GPT-4)
        EXT-->>AG: Keywords + generated content
        AG-->>WE: Wave 2 complete

        WE->>AG: Wave 3: Social + Email + Ads (parallel, depends on Wave 2)
        AG->>EXT: Social → Meta + LinkedIn
        AG->>EXT: Email → Brevo
        AG->>EXT: Ads → Google Ads
        EXT-->>AG: Distribution confirmations
        AG-->>WE: Wave 3 complete
    end

    rect rgb(253, 203, 110, 0.1)
        Note over WE,MEM: LEARNING LOOP
        WE->>MEM: Log execution results
        MEM->>MEM: Score agent performance
        MEM->>MEM: Update decision weights
        MEM->>DB: Persist learnings (long-term)
        MEM->>DB: Cache hot data (Redis)
    end

    WE-->>B: Execution complete
    B-->>API: Campaign result payload
    API-->>U: 200 OK + campaign summary
    Note over U: Real-time updates via WebSocket during execution
